[I] A simple convenience library for handling processes in C++11

[T] process-cpp is a simple wrapper around process creation and control on
[T] Linux. It handles child processes with stream redirection, offers
[T] thread-safe access to the current process environment and type-safe
[T] access to the proc filesystem, mainly to assist in testing.

[U] https://gitlab.com/ubports/development/core/lib-cpp/process-cpp

